# {{context|uncountable|slang|lang=en}} Sticky matter accumulated between digits of a foot.
# {{context|countable|lang=en}} A [[stubbed]] toe.
# {{context|countable|lang=en}} A rock-climbing maneuver entailing exerting force with two opposite surfaces of the toe of a shod foot, against two different rock surfaces, for the purpose of preventing motion of that foot in a direction parallel to both of those rock surfaces.

